+## 8/29/23 · `EDGcpfe/26614`
+
+**GNU C compatibility: Type of some bit-field expressions**  
+*C-score +13; hits: c11, gnu c, bit field, bit-field, signed char, _generic*
+
+```text
+
+Consider, in GNU C11 mode:
+
+  extern int printf(char const*, ...);
+  struct {
+    unsigned u: 8;
+  } s;
+  int main() {
+    printf("%s\n", _Generic((s.u),
+                            unsigned char: "uchar",
+                            unsigned int: "uint",
+                            default: "unknown"));
+  }
