+```text
+
+A new flag has been added to the il_header; il_has_C_semantics indicates
+whether the IL has C semantics (TRUE) or C++ semantics (FALSE).  The IL
+has C language semantics if the source program was compiled in C mode,
+or if the source program was compiled in C++ mode and then lowered.  There are
