+
+**C99 _Bool type after lowering**  
+*C-score +3; hits: c99*
+
+```text
+
+Previously, the "bool_type" flag of the IL entry representing the C99 _Bool
+type was set to FALSE by IL lowering (thereby making the type it describes
+identical to the underlying integer type of _Bool).  This is no longer done:
+The bool_type flag remains TRUE in the lowered IL.
