+// SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0 WITH LLVM-exception
+// Origin: edgcpp/compiler tests/tests/imported/clang/c (Apache-2.0 WITH
+// LLVM-exception).  Adapted into LCCC by scripts/edg_corpus_mine.py.
+//type: fn
